<% content_for :title, "Terms of Service - Pairin" %>
<% content_for :description, "The terms for using Pairin to find and run pair-programming sessions." %>

<div class="px-6 md:px-16 lg:px-24 py-16 md:py-20 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
  <a href="<%= root_path %>" class="text-sm font-bold text-purple hover:underline">&larr; Back to Pairin</a>

  <h1 class="font-display font-extrabold text-4xl md:text-5xl tracking-tight leading-none mt-6 mb-2">Terms of Service</h1>
  <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mb-10">Last updated <%= Date.current.strftime("%B %-d, %Y") %></p>

  <div class="prose max-w-none text-gray-700 leading-relaxed space-y-6">
    <p>
      By creating an account or using <a href="<%= root_url %>" class="text-purple font-bold">pairin.dev</a>, you
      agree to these terms. Pairin is currently in beta &mdash; features, availability, and these terms may change
      as the product evolves.
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl text-black mt-10 mb-3">Using Pairin</h2>
    <p>
      Pairin is free during its beta period. You're responsible for the accuracy of what you post (pair requests,
      profile details, retros) and for your conduct toward other members. Be respectful &mdash; Pairin exists to
      help developers pair and learn together.
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl text-black mt-10 mb-3">Your account</h2>
    <p>
      You're responsible for keeping your login credentials secure and for activity that happens under your
      account. You must be able to enter into this agreement to sign up.
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl text-black mt-10 mb-3">Content you share</h2>
    <p>
      You keep ownership of what you post. By sharing a retro publicly via Session Summaries, you're giving other
      signed-in Pairin members permission to view it within the product. You can stop sharing future retros at any
      time; this doesn't retroactively unpublish retros you've already shared.
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl text-black mt-10 mb-3">Beta disclaimer</h2>
    <p>
      Pairin is provided "as is" during its beta period, without warranties of any kind. We'll do our best to keep
      things running smoothly, but availability and features aren't guaranteed while we're actively building.
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl text-black mt-10 mb-3">Ending your account</h2>
    <p>
      You can stop using Pairin at any time. We may suspend or terminate accounts that violate these terms or misuse
      the platform.
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl text-black mt-10 mb-3">Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about these terms? Reach us at
      <a href="mailto:hello@pairin.dev" class="text-purple font-bold">hello@pairin.dev</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
